<title>PORTUGAL: Yield 5.2491 pct on Portuguese 364-day bills.</title>
<headline>Yield 5.2491 pct on Portuguese 364-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield eased to 5.2491 percent, from 5.3476 percent previously, at the Institute for Public Credit Management's sale of 364-day bills, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>The Institute placed 10.5 billion escudos.</p>
<p>--LISBON BUREAU 3511-3150035</p>
